<title>USA: U.S. barge rates - Trade moderate on call.</title>
<headline>U.S. barge rates - Trade moderate on call.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. barge rates were moderately traded on Thursday on the St. Louis Merchants Exchange call session.</p>
<p>Eight barges traded versus none on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Trades, bids and offers included:</p>
<p>- Two barges, McGregor and South, Mid-Mississippi River, week of August 31, traded at 160 percent of tariff.</p>
<p>- Four barges, Mid-Mississippi River, two each week of August 24 and 31, traded at 155 percent.</p>
</text>
